# Vendored remote files, refreshed by the commit pipeline on every push.
# Format: <url> = <dest>.
#
# DOMPurify stays pinned, not auto-refreshed: the SVG import path is tuned
# around its exact behavior, so upstream drift lands by hand, not by push.

# pica.js stays out: its vendored build has no verified upstream byte match,
# and it processes local bitmaps with no security surface worth the drift.
